      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7337f47da33bd473b1f27339",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "换装游戏差不多也该结束了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acf4cb2789d2ef75dd822646023515e6daf31bb15a8dd928e323143e5e223ca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b6032d77323e673fdcc3f80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れさま",
      "source_fingerprint": "42e316ccf364c3b60da2c4b548c5e7063508a601e4f130f5848b788a25db9095",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e742bef607c986df14a1c4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…そう、競うのね。\r\n……じゃあ走りましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dc9a93485f00c6e88acfb900f85b970481cc4d4a535535dca472b460b95c3d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c378d485a1587fc01ea56f25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…勝利することが私の誓い。\r\n次こそは…逃したりしない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed1fe1e928a249f9ebb6640cbc4f8759bf0f41b5a97b488c7c289847b48c7ce7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03e69d2f2ebd33bc19b95da4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经看不见星星了……\n现在开始，是我独自奔跑的时间了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c551a3008d17cdcd16828bbe9db6d8183f9e5cb635a51af27f3bde40278e0db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2436aec3acfb5295006f58d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好。\n……………………\n……有什么事吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8e5fd563c3a1f6cc08a8e08ca2febd90a57bbecb847bd4244199a965d4a0333",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a0a5aa853b4088e4a3ee71e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在去吃午饭吗？\n大概又会遇上那群吵吵嚷嚷的人们吧……\n哈啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "47b4ddd042c5640e4b43b6cfee0a78cbc837281d167d8d2fe28da792e19eab35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:928f8665644d9772a0e9adb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我正好也觉得你差不多快来了。\n已经到训练的时间了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1bb676ce76a1ca32879c762032b4ac4c992aca96cab61f08c555703f8133431",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:551a7fe2a269149138deada3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……还有工作吗？\n这样……辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e46ee01edd199f8e4340163674a59e26dec127c576b01a9e75f8a90197fac792",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd49658ae8b819f6aac9bc5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我不是把联系方式告诉过你吗？\n那为什么这时候了还特地跑来这种地方……\n你真是……哈啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b992b93a40a08cc432c01be9c49c59530967414312879a9a4184620c1a22faa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e92ae632197c0634e735a7e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "季节变化的时候，一切都像坏掉了一样……\n天气和身体状况都是……哈啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "30bee66b351e6b3d8e9345aa33ae8e76f92b6779e8f31f9a7adee624b97bb0b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a4c46bcefc0e4849e4a0a46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被称作大三角的那三颗星星，\n无论在什么地方都一直闪耀着光芒呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2a4e7ca6fce795f5cbacbd2bb448de881e86bde5bfc45bb4b746bdc13775c6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dba8a0665563329fe16d36f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的天空比昨天更清澈……\n今晚的星星也会更漂亮的吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0da51b28e5e910fbcc89f9fb7bb8978e7a3e0064c37da99106ca28068f31c71c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9fa5c3f330ad2d866e50439",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿嚏！………………\n只是鼻子有些痒而已。\n我的身体没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17935637405b88357d1e6d7ab89a48f57cb691dab7602351b759de9838fc7ce2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9008bf76216b21c613a02774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我真的很感谢机伶。\n毕竟这个……\n我一个人是穿不上的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86af23fcd2648c9f0418643d0004300cdbf171e3d6e1c37228dde40422380929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17178f3c22f07109933bfa53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……大家都非常高兴啊。什么“眼福”啦，\n还有“尊爆”之类的……\n明明我只是早上向爱丽数码打了个招呼而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26b4551c676c62027177bba267849322862a8c4270e966f9786a589509cffb08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cef5583fa432a7d9d745284f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午饭……意大利面……蛋包饭……不，\n还是BLT三明治吧。不要加番茄酱，\n……沾到衣服上，会很麻烦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9893a803ba77294619e7c440c48090697c6bf144326d5ddc1ee3b171af4dafb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1565abc6562c74258a6301c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怒涛……那孩子，今天也\n在吃着火红的咖喱……\n不过她看起来很幸福，应该没问题吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a09ec7bd1b7f35166150b9521381bb83bbc574fc61727b267885fd4e45dd98a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c82bf59cc1338a6c9d885ffd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身装扮，要配得上……\n要配得上那孩子，也要配得上我自己……\n……我再去，多跑一会儿吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa478738c62afa5f5f202a8a4731e4a831b01cdea713d10a9f40a158af7c8e37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8ca57b7d9c354aa9dfc3933",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家用的天文馆投影仪，\n是以前父母送给我的。\n在看不见星星的夜晚，真的很有用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd85f085ac6d5fc5659c68438516c189aefe1062b0c1353268ec2f0d447d7317",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60c1d36ff9df0e5af7db228e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于把被子烘干机换新了。\n提前查了一下春季促销，真是太好了。\n……这样，梅雨季就不用担心了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bf2875b763bac7665deb523175c6744f6b3228f2f203be7e0a3d3ece8b2a3c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6d68b3b7d77f304a6e00007",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时候，总是被问到同一个问题。\n怎样才能让头发不炸开。\n……用护发素不是就够了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c5c0069902712a63412a29801e13430c14276babd65870b50dfcf5c5e2ac7f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b052137959888974b4cb9eb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "山……要不要再去一次呢……\n这个季节，夜晚也很长……\n还能和那孩子，好好聊聊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d42d47f3b4ccf594e314d743d40f1243aff7f805cece339d09ce06cff471cf3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:462035db241a74e2617f16b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起跑完步后，成田路给了我暖宝宝……\n明明她自己的鼻尖也冻得通红。\n真是的……真拿她没办法……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e8b9170e6307578e1ab753ab25b86bc52676c41102bc4478c2db64c1f1d4ca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3266212590091453e96a432e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90280b16b8756fe4ba7f5b09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd79179e75b725ead7ec57ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……不用勉强自己找话题的。\n我讨厌现在这样拼命找话说的气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2a79b85ca6c42840869e7ecdc61c280bb6a6771403216ae627f467de39f804f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:092b08c6ae14edc897661129",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我写的字，\n好像和妈妈和外婆一样，\n都会向右下倾斜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d39b97c41bae450514bf9262b7f0d6acdf5d119d745ea84bd0a68066c4d9ae5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82b6b4fd295329d56525ee28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "歌剧王发来了『紧急联络』？\n请无视掉吧。\n我讨厌被卷入她一时兴起的杂事中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ae43177468075e7f9717bac692793c91a8994baf8c0f2d171f35c17901ad6a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc17310ab196da518fa63fbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怒涛好像明天想和我并跑训练。\n……反正对我们双方都有益，\n考虑一下也没什么损失。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2e69af29b6efea159a6e9d55415e17364ec491d295e49ee62e00285fbcec185",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ba2b0a75b0140c376db9aff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头发和尾巴都有些自己保养不到\n的地方……但是去美容院\n又太浪费时间了……哈啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f52322bcbee07cdedc82f7578ee68648ac1164cf22a6892cd8a99eed9091ec9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc3fcc5bdac1307b63ec798d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果站在舞台上的话……\n为了将笑容传递给粉丝们，\n也得鼓起勇气唱歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe8e54901b70c73767a9f8d8e0c2b456f4b692c130c62bc7a350206ceaad0c0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:838a9b6d844ec7d9bdc59976",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……和大家穿一样的衣服我倒是没什么意见。\n但是，腹部的布料会不会太少了点？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3faed23ad0f183b83cabe9f0c5ff8c7a96897475a85fbc66966ff20129f9b8a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eebef32d716ac2b5512bff2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……哼哼……啦啦啦……\n啦啦……——啊。\n哈啊……你还在啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "629d2df274ca0d03e92c00561cb34fd5feb07545672303464e37298319f6246d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4615f1d7911c764302a77b45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……能让我进行宣誓的仪式的，\n只有一个人。我绝不会把王冠\n交给那个瞎闹的霸王大人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d95f887544ebd1067812b8594fc61166e7f9696190d353e85435dcb7a824925",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ef761f34410e7a370531d46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……卡莲同学很奇怪呢。\n明明每次都是被闹铃声吵起来的，\n却说我像个姐姐一样照顾她……很奇怪啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f19b5a38d9772dd60070b53cfedb4cde26906ea3c575c0f2460b355f54d55617",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1980a947dbcc32c9d1151018",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休时成田路同学也一直忙着\n帮别人……既然是休息时间的话，\n先以自己的休息为重才好吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee48449bd1092f8bcec46caaae6b33fde18f4a783f2b257732751a4615b92743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07aea9594fbd74b2f1cd0e2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……原来如此，要比一比啊。  \n……那就来跑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0256542e908f50252128ed8e937f73e68ed3d85dd7581716a684a43fb7077205",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ed2bda9683c0f8d8568d9dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "左手好像有点肿……\n睡前的伸展运动得小心点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b335c4a4dbe8ccda2cc49d02b429e1d413ebc78765c1d8b11a1d81a003416a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fa2ac232457aee50541f256",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白天也变得越来越久了呢。\n要不要也延长下训练的时间呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ad4a98f537edb823db50a82c3c9e26a9448c810e7ce89c4251710dab50e1dec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b087d566fe0b2c7b83b5edea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……既然没什么大比赛的话，\n要进步就趁现在了。\n而且，秋天可是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ccace6d71d96a2a977cf572825f23329d5ef41a6e1d4a2db5fa58854d4e0db7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:795f601d6771ec5d80bda273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近变得挺冷了呢……\n差不多该把羊绒围巾拿出……\n啊，还早吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "826f33a8ff4c4a458476bf4111b316709d5967a7b7d745ab091c918322253f6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d82ce06a3a16ed83bd4f5dd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……不管外边有多冷，\n拥有电热毯的我现在都是毫无破绽。\n今晚，暖呼呼软绵绵的被子也在等着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94fa260512740597029250a54d7bf8b32e6714a7d926531a3154fc8c350054f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f57d39b0c5b83bd53ba4b86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呐。你之前好像在搜懒人沙发吧，\n打算放在哪里呢？是放在训练员办公室吗？\n还有，品牌是哪家的？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7f71df0d968a8f0037e78913d8c07837703f0c37db8b0eedb53c7529238883c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cda0119426641b003eb6fbeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『爱织』这个称呼，\n最开始也就只有成田路会这么叫我，\n没想到现在会传开成这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc58c10d55859a80c1d6a0ecf63b17b44d0c179f00f3040d85ee39653d64879c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebfbed073c6e06760143d045",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……这种打扮，算是名媛风吗？\n要说闪闪发光的话……\n强击的眼睛，更耀眼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a17ee9c88d8dc63a05f446ca5d1035f530199882624c279544d39ebdc39d3fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f59af15c556291d9aeafdaf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…信念同学。有时候比我还要练得晚，\n她那种坚持的态度，我也得向她学习才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16e66cbc01c3ad979b219730ce95664d4d24f188201854273f0a8672c0971583",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34596e79f7cb78b6c541469e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞老人为什么要选驯鹿做搭档呢？\n如果只是拉雪橇的话，\n西伯利亚哈士奇也可以吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "444b03d5771115ce0047a6082b28b06f532d341b87724868b370a7062e4aa185",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ddb864355533ed11c582432",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为演出需要才穿成这样的……\n大家的视线……要是我能连心也\n变成『冰之女王』就好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f9262343c4876b4622995181ae1fadcf305bd9c837e0d33e4c3b15716b0b984",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6040fb4ed018faa492fbf0c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和茶座同学一起做的饼干……\n还剩下些……给你吧。很配咖啡的。\n……午休时间的话，你也该休息一下吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "80c56006abf6232c8fad631a41c85e40b0a8d844ad3fe4f19c9171f787e68534",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f40a4e0e96d261c291d604b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明已经拒绝了好几次……还是被\n邀请去参加晚宴秀、歌剧。\n……唉。也许去了反而更轻松。",
      "source_fingerprint": "967b69f996d858c75b51347922b4f24b3757545b0bff57c3e3277730fc97168d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebd7771585f9d0854ab0d43f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪已经融化，春天悄然来临——\n如今，冰之女王也该到沉睡的季节了。\n……不过，我还没有打算从舞台上退场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ea70fca166f03780d5954e71edf412bd42d96510e31b8b53fd4cb1af5af6081",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d438f66f9faa5415c364c13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……什么？看起来我很热吗？  \n我才没有勉强自己……\n才没，有呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8dd8bfd050da213134a78fa44c1016348ce4cf25843eee1f9e7169bf8b1b05d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e7f62e9839135d4c5139513",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……喂。我想读的那本书的续集，\n你是不是借走了？  \n……真是个温柔、的人呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b242b294265c00395696f78ab6fe1a44671d9eb8b6ef9fd8baa22d2a157cc4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:813753ea4bb4e8ec2c847dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞树顶的星星，我并不需要……\n比起那个，我更想珍惜，\n那在天空中闪烁的光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9d7f743e4afdbb1508065a38497415036a3b3c2732483a609a6d91c17cc1d0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fe8ddbb6979319c0630490f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我觉得这件衣服很漂亮。  \n毛绒绒的部分……  \n既温暖，手感也很好……嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16203a88f84af6369b5023350a45dd732172361e08022e8de21dfda9c0565391",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5310cc8d1f0530c85e7829e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姑且还是配合服装，把发型也……\n虽然不太擅长细细打理……\n不过，这次还算做得不错",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2a8fa63c44bfb78b8a08f7ee8f091c317bbf9c74deaa3ac662fba0b02f9e8ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "91029"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
